{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36601","headline":"衡阳泊木居士庙下作 · 罗隐","name":"衡阳泊木居士庙下作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乌噪残阳草满庭，此中枯木似人形。\n只应神物长爲主，未必浮槎即有灵。\n八月风波飘不去，四时黍稷荐惟馨。\n南朝庾信无因赋，牢落祠前水气腥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36601.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36601","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}